# Keep the docker build context to what the multi-stage build actually
# reads (source + manifests). Without this, a local `docker build` /
# `fly deploy --dockerfile` uploads the full checkout — including a
# multi-GB target/ — to the builder. CI image builds always ran from a
# clean checkout, which is why the gap never surfaced there (GH #101).
target
.git
.worktrees
workspace
.claude
.mcp.json
.ryo
